<title>USA: BASEBALL-RESULTS OF PLAYOFF GAMES ON WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-RESULTS OF PLAYOFF GAMES ON WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Major League Baseball</p>
<p>divisional series playoff games on Wednesday (home team in</p>
<p>CAPS):</p>
<p>		American League</p>
<p> BALTIMORE	  7	Cleveland	 4</p>
<p>(Baltimore leads best-of-five series 2-0)</p>
<p> NEW YORK	   5	Texas	     4 (12 innings)</p>
<p>	 (Best-of-five series tied 1-1)</p>
<p>		National League</p>
<p> Atlanta	    2	LOS ANGELES     1 (10 innings)</p>
<p>(Atlanta leads best-of-five series 1-0)</p>
</text>
